                            	   619: ; ResetHandler_NES - Entry point into translated Zelda code
                            	   620: ; This bridges the Genesis init to the NES reset handler
                            	   621: ; The actual NES reset handler is in bank_FF_gen68k_vdp.asm
                            	   622: ; ?.??.??.??.??.??.??.??.??.??.??.??.??.??.??.??.??.??.??.??.??.??.??.??.??.??.??.??.??.??.??.??.??.??.??.??.??.??.??.?
                            	   623: ResetHandler_NES:
                            	   624:     ; NES reset is in bank_FF (the fixed bank)
                            	   625:     ; After our Genesis init above, skip the NES hardware init
                            	   626:     ; (SEI, CLD, stack setup) since we've done it Genesis-style
                            	   627:     ; Jump straight to the game init proper
